{"parse": {"title": "巴别塔词砖", "pageid": 132320, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"巴别塔词砖\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/10/CurrencyItem-3403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"巴别塔词砖\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>巴别塔词砖</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-3403 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-3403_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#3403</div></div><hr /><div>既是流通言语的词，又是构筑高塔的砖。可用于解锁更多的职称和资源。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">人们总是用拥有物的数量来判断一个人在社群中的地位，在这个充满怪人的聊天室中，语言词汇囤积癖或许也是一种客观存在的症状。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "巴别塔词砖"}}